For improved performance, whenever possible, include transform and opacity in
your animations over top, left, bottom, right, and visibility. Not only does it
improve performance by using the GPU over the CPU, but when you change box-
model properties, the browser needs to reflow and repaint, which is bad for perfor‐
mance. Just don’t put everything on the GPU, or you’ll run into different performance
issues.
